SWOP_TR003_coated_3.icc
=======================

Origin: colord 1.4.7, data/profiles (https://github.com/hughsie/colord),
as installed by the Debian package colord-data 1.4.7-3 at
/usr/share/color/icc/colord/SWOP_TR003_coated_3.icc.
SHA-256: 92eaa9cb3517288968ca88e897252b9f4f51fecece1de0d18bd512aafe244e91
Profile description "SWOP TR003 Coated", copyright tag "This profile is
free of known copyright restrictions". Made with ArgyllCMS by Richard
Hughes from the characterization data of the ANSI CGATS/SWOP technical
report below.

