Source of the characterization data: ANSI CGATS/SWOP TR 003-2007,
"Color Characterization Data for SWOP proofing on Grade 3 coated paper".

paint.c embeds the file unchanged (cmake/PcCodecDeps.cmake, PcEmbed) as
the default CMYK source profile (pc_icc_cmyk_default_profile).
